Though my vision remained hazy, I could still make out\nHimeo standing in front of me, holding her hair so it\nwouldn't fall into her eyes as she leaned against the\ndesk.%K%P
我朦朦胧胧的视野中，映出了长发飘飘，歪着脑袋，\n一只手扶在桌子上，凝视着我的姬绪小姐。%K%P
But as I looked around, I realized I wasn't at the Terrace\nHouse Hinosaka, but a wide, open space with numerous desks\nand chairs...%K%P
可是四下一瞧，\n这里不是Terrace House阳之坂，\n而是许多的桌椅井然地排列在一起的宽广前厅…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWait. Huh?! Are we at work?!\d%K%P
「哎、哎哎？\n难、难道现在，是在工作中吗！？」%K%P
As my vision cleared up and my brain awoke from its\nslumber, I leapt out of my chair in a panic, realizing the\nseverity of my situation.%K%P
视界中的景象惊醒了大脑，\n想起了这里并不是休息的场所之后，\n我慌张地一跃而起。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Huh? Where is everyone?\d%K%P
「…哎，咦？\n其他人呢？」%K%P
I glanced at the clock -- it was a few minutes past ten.\nI saw only darkness beyond the windows.%K%P
我看了一眼钟表，时间刚刚过了１０点钟。\n望向窗外，已经满是夜色沉沉了。%K%P
Still, usually at least ten other people would stay behind\nat this hour. We were a trading company, after all.%K%P
即便如此，平日里在这个时间段，也有至少十人会留下来。\n毕竟这也是家商务公司。%K%P
Yet, for whatever reason, Himeo and I -- the Sawashima\nTeam -- were the only ones in the office.%K%P
…然而这里，不知为何只有我和姫绪小姐的\n『泽嶋董事班子』留了下来。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dHalf of them left for home, and the other half went to\nthe celebration. I imagine they must be partying right\nabout now.\d%K%P
「一半回家了，一半跑去开庆功宴了。\n如今这里很冷清，不是再正常不过了么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThe celebration...?\d%K%P
「庆功…哎？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dHuh? Did a few minutes of sleep make you forget\neverything you did today?\d%K%P
「你啊，才睡了几个小时，\n就忘了今天自己获得的成就吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToday...?\d%K%P
「今天…？」%K%P
Today, I... prepared some documents for the Real Estate\nDivision at midnight, returned to my usual duties in\nAccounting at 2AM, and took some emergency sleep around\n5AM.%K%P
话说回来，今天…\n从０点开始撰写地产部相关的结账资料，\n两点钟回归会计部的本职工作，５点时在休息室小睡了一会儿。%K%P
At 6AM, I went to inspect the location and returned around\n10AM, after which I estimated the yearly budget for all\nour departments. There was also that union meeting during\nlunch break...%K%P
６点钟赶赴地镇祭的现场，\n１０点钟回去，参与各部下一年度的预算交涉。\n午休时出席工会的会议…%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dThe executive meeting at 5PM today! Not only did the\nArima Reconstruction Project catch up despite being over a\nmonth behind, now it's proceeding ahead of schedule!\d%K%P
「５点钟开了职员会！\n为了挽回蚁马再开发计划耽误的一个月日程，\n然后你就渐渐地昏过去了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOh... that.\d%K%P
「啊、啊～」%K%P
The way I started listing things from ages ago made Himeo\nlose her cool -- she actually gave me a straight answer\nthis time.%K%P
我的回想也有些错乱了吗，\n姬绪小姐把这些一五一十地都告诉了我。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dIt seems like we'll be reaching the predicted profit\nmargin. Actually, we might need to revise expectations\naltogether. All the executives who were shaking in their\nboots last month seemed eager to start celebrating today.\d%K%P
「这个季度，预测的收益看来是达到了，而且是绰绰有余。\n不仅如此，也许还会有上方修正。\n…一个月之前还愁眉不展的社长他们，现在简直喜笑颜开了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's amazing, right?! I'm so glad to have been granted\nthe honor of being a part of this company!\d%K%P
「真的是太了不起了！\n我，加入这家公司真是太好了！」%K%P
According to Vice President Yoshitomi, our numbers for the\nyear were looking fantastic, despite the slow beginning\nand the many setbacks we had at the end of last year.%K%P
据吉富副社长所说，道浜商事下半期的业绩，\n从新年之后，仿佛在宣示着序盘只是低调般\n奇迹般地描划出了一条上升曲线。%K%P
I could feel an almost palpable energy in the office over\nthe past days, with many employees staying longer than\nthey were required just to push us closer to our goal.%K%P
且不说今天，最近员工之中，也是斗志昂扬，\n每天每夜都工作到深夜。\n收获了这个成果，也是理所当然的吧…%K%P
