「才不是这么回事儿吧？\n公司可不是一个人能支撑起来的。\n这全是大家的努力所致」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYeah, everyone went far beyond what they were required to\ndo. ...Almost as though a death-defying monster was at\ntheir heels.\d%K%P
「嗯嗯，大家都在拼命地努力着。\n…简直就像是都被拥有不死之身的怪物威胁了一样」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat sounds like one very diligent monster.\d%K%P
「那还真是个勤勉认真的怪物啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dOh, I bet everyone at the party is busy complaining about\nsaid monster right now. To think it would be brazen enough\nto run the chief around while skipping a month's worth of\nwork...\d%K%P
「如今，兴致勃勃的那个怪物，可是张开了血盆大口呢。\n他说『明明偷懒了一个月，竟敢连部长都支使了』\n…这样子哦」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...That definitely sounds like one bold subordinate.\d%K%P
「…也有混横不讲理的部下呢」%K%P
I felt needles in her look.%K%P
姬绪小姐朝向我的视线好像突然锋利起来。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d...I would appreciate it if you stopped involving the\nentire company in your attempt to escape reality. What am\nI going to do if everyone collapses from exhaustion?\d%K%P
「…自己想逃避现实，就不要把公司都卷进来。\n大家要是过度疲劳，那可怎么办啊？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut... but just the other day, you and Vice Chief Hiragi\ntold me to try and depend on others a bit more...\d%K%P
「可是，平木副部长也好，姫绪小姐也好，\n都说让我『更多依靠别人』的…」%K%P
I interpreted that as permission to use the \dexecutive\norders\d card with anyone who was being uncooperative.%K%P
所以，我又拿出了『董事命令』这柄尚方宝剑。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI never told you to work them to death!\nHalf of our staff looks shellshocked.\d%K%P
「不要说得这么轻巧啊！\n这两个星期，大家都消瘦了…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, let bygones be bygones.\nIt's already over, anyway.\d%K%P
「嘛，这不是挺好的么。\n这可不今天就结束了么」%K%P
Now that we had moved to this stage, most of the remaining\nwork would be carried out by the construction company we\ncontracted.%K%P
今天，有了可喜可贺成立的新现场，\n今后的主要业务，就是和建设公司的客户打交道了。%K%P
We'd probably have to help them with revisions and various\nother tasks, but it should take most of the workload off\nour shoulders.%K%P
从明天开始，虽然会有各式各样的业务调整，\n但我们公司的负荷也会飞跃性地下降吧。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dIn the end, you just don't listen. No matter what we try\nto tell you.\d%K%P
「到头来…无论我们多么苦口婆心，\n你还是有你的一定之规啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHimeo...?\d%K%P
「姫绪小姐…？」%K%P
But Himeo seemed to be enraged over something other than\nme temporarily seizing control of the company behind her\nback.%K%P
可是，无论她如何对我发怒，\n我也没有把公司据为己有的私心。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dNo matter how many times I asked you to take a break, you\nkept working without going home... or contacting Toko or\nMs. Teacher even once.\d%K%P
「告诉你多少次要休息了，可你还是拼命工作，\n也不回公寓一次，\n都不和小都子还有老师联系」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell...\d%K%P
「那是…」%K%P
It had already been two weeks since that night when Himeo\ndragged me home by force.%K%P
我被姬绪小姐，强行带回去的第二周。%K%P
Ultimately, after spending that weekend at the boarding\nhouse, I left for work and ended up not going back to my\nroom even once.%K%P
结果，从那个周末以来，\n直到如今，我都没有再回去过。%K%P
I left my room with a bag full of my things, and used the\nnapping room, the laundry room, and the convenience store\nas my home instead.%K%P
整理好衣装与公文包，走出房间，\n在休息室与洗衣店与便利店之间行动，三点一线，\n和往常一样，过着住在公司的生活。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dDid we do all of that for nothing?\nHow long are you planning to keep on running, Osamu?\d%K%P
「我们所做的，难道都白费了吗？\n理先生…你，又打算逃避到何时呢？」%K%P
I could no longer feel either anger or exasperation in her\nwords, only genuine worry, exhaustion, and loneliness.%K%P
姫绪小姐的话语里，并没有愤怒，并没有惊讶，\n只是单纯的担心、慰劳，还有一些寂寞。%K%P
From her perspective, the problem concerned two third\nparties and shouldn't have had anything to do with her\ndirectly, yet she worried for us all the same.%K%P
自己以外的人，\n为了自己以外的人而烦恼，\n她对此毫不在乎，依然关心着我。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt wasn't for... nothing.\nThat night helped me make it this far.\d%K%P
「并不是没有用…吧。\n若是没有那天，我也不会努力到今天」%K%P
Ms. Kaya was also like that, but...%K%P
夏夜小姐，也是如此…%K%P
The women around me were not only attractive, but also\ngood at looking out for others; as a result, I would\nconstantly find myself in situations where I didn't know\nwhat to do with myself.%K%P
我身边的女人们，都太富于魅力，\n对我照顾有加，让我的心中也十分困扰。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWe never told you to hold up.\nWe simply asked you to stop running away...\d%K%P
「不要说什么努力不努力的了。\n我们只是劝你，不要逃避…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's why I stopped.\d%K%P
「所以，我不会逃避了」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI don't see how you've changed compared to last month.\nYou still avoided coming home so you could avoid having to\nface them!\d%K%P
「但你和一个月前比也没什么起色啊…\n忙于工作，夜不归家…\n和她们见都不见一面！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHad I met them... my determination would waver.\n...I'm easily influenced, as you no doubt know.\d%K%P
「因为，就算见了面也无法做出决断。\n…我就是这么优柔寡断」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI know that, but...\d%K%P
「这一点我很同意…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI kept them in my thoughts... in my own way. Toko and\nAsami. ...The two women I love.\d%K%P
「所以，我一个人苦苦地思索着就好了。\n都子也好，麻实也好。\n…我深爱的人们也好」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dOsamu...\d%K%P
「理先生…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI kept thinking about them so much I ended up developing\nwithdrawal symptoms due to not being able to be at their\nside. But I swore to myself I'd avoid all contact until I\ncame to a decision.\d%K%P
「我一直考虑着她们的事，\n在出现想要见到她们的禁断症状之前，我都要一直思考下去，\n在得出结论之前我是不会见她们的…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI gave everything ample thought.\d%K%P
「拼命地，思索着」%K%P
I kept thinking about it without giving myself any time to\nrest, to the point I even lost consciousness. And once I\ncame to, I kept on thinking like nothing had happened.%K%P
不睡觉也要去想。\n意识模糊也要去想。\n睡了片刻醒来后，也要继续想。%K%P
I loved Toko and I loved Asami. Yet those obvious\nstatements no longer meant anything at this point.%K%P
我，爱着都子。\n我，爱着麻实。\n这种显而易见的结论，事到如今已经无所谓了。%K%P
But if I had to choose one over the other...%K%P
只是，要决定世界上我至爱的话…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI was just doing my job on the side. I figured I might as\nwell do something to keep my hands busy if I wasn't\nsleeping anyway.\d%K%P
「工作，那是顺便在做的。\n反正是睡不着，不如爬起来工作」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dThat's the amount you do \don the side\d?\nYou kind of scare me sometimes, you know.\d%K%P
「顺便做就做了那么大量的工作…？\n你这人，在某种意义上真是可怕啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dApparently, it was possible to juggle work and private\nmatters.\d%K%P
「看来公事和私事是可以一起处理的」%K%P
My body might have reached its absolute limit, but my\nbrain seemed to still be functioning a little.%K%P
身体…虽然有些要撑不住了，\n但精神，还可以勉力支撑着运转。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dSo... did you come to a decision?\d%K%P
「那…得出结论了么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI don't know.\d%K%P
「我不明白」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dS-Seriously...?!\d%K%P
「你、你啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's just that... I had this dream.\d%K%P
「只是，我做了一个梦」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dA dream...?\d%K%P
「梦…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYes. Her dream.\d%K%P
「嗯…关于她的，梦」%K%P
